# 📚 Binary Search (Part 1) - Introduction & Fundamentals

## 📌 Introduction

**Binary Search** is an efficient searching algorithm used to find an element in a **sorted array**. Unlike Linear Search, which checks every element one by one, Binary Search repeatedly divides the search space into two halves, making it much faster for large datasets.

It follows the **Divide and Conquer** technique.

