# 4️⃣ Algorithm

```
Start

Low = 0

High = n-1

while(low <= high)

    mid = low + (high-low)/2

    if(arr[mid] == target)

        return mid

    else if(target > arr[mid])

        low = mid + 1

    else

        high = mid - 1

If not found

return -1
```

